--- FAR <-> Visual Source Safe Plugin --- version 1.00

The purpose of FarVss plugin is to make simple interface from Far file 
panels or Far editor to Microsoft Visual Source Safe. Plugin provide 
some basics Vss features for file/selected files:
 - Check In.
 - Check Out.
 - Get Last Version.
 - Add file.
 - Show difference.

Easy configuration utitlity 
(F9->"Options"->"Plugins configuration"->"Vss configure" in Far panel mode)
parameters:
 - Full path to ss.exe.
 - Vss user name.
 - Vss user password.
 - Size of text block (in rows) to output when mismatch found (Show difference command)
 - Beep on (turn off to silent mode).
 - Ask for additional agreement.

Plugin consists of:
 - FarVss.dll (plugin library file).
 - *.hlf (help files)
 - *.lng (message files)
 - FarVss.reg (registry file for "hot" keys:
				Ctrl+Alt+O  - Check Out,
				Ctrl+Alt+I  - Check In,
				Ctrl+Alt+G  - Get Last Version,
				Ctrl+Alt+A  - Add file to project,
				Ctrl+Alt+D  - Show difference).

To install plugin you will have to make following steps:
 - Create subdir named FarVss in ..Far\Plugins\.
 - Copy plugin contents there.
 - Execute file FarVss.reg (if you want to use "hot" keys).
 - Reload Far.

Requirements:
You need to have Vss client software installed.

Additional information: 
Plugin tested for VSS 6.0 and FAR 1.64.

